            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Scopriamo come contare gli elementi negli array e usare queste informazioni in modo intelligente.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Array length",
            "id": 127047,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usiamo la proprietà <code>count</code> dopo il nome dell'array e un punto <code>.</code> per ottenere il numero di elementi in un array.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" tasks = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;windows&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;vacuum&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(tasks.\" /><text value=\"count\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></output></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Length 2",
            "id": 127048,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Prova tu: inizia con il nome dell'array e aggiungi un punto <code>.</code> e poi <code>count</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" tasks = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;windows&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;vacuum&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(tasks.\" /><text value=\"count\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"items\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"61\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>tasks</code>, seguito da <code>.</code> e infine <code>count</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Printing",
            "id": 127049,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiungi <code>print()</code> intorno a <code>tasks.count</code> per visualizzare la lunghezza dell'array <code>tasks</code> nella console.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" tasks = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;windows&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;vacuum&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(tasks.\" /><text value=\"count\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"61\" endIndex=\"62\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>print</code>, seguito da <code>(</code> e infine <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Assigning 1",
            "id": 127050,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo anche memorizzare il numero di elementi di un array in una variabile.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" tasks = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;windows&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;vacuum&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"count\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\" = tasks.\" /><text value=\"count\" class=\"built_in\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"count\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></output></code></body></html>"
