            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crea una variabile <code>length</code> e memorizzaci il numero di elementi dell'array.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" tasks = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;windows&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;vacuum&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" length = tasks.\" /><text value=\"count\" class=\"built_in\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(length)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"items\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"68\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>length</code>, seguito da <code>=</code> e infine <code>tasks.count</code>.</p></body></html>"
