            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Anche se l'array <code>tasks</code> è vuoto, <code>tasks.count</code> ci restituisce il numero di elementi che contiene.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" tasks = [\" /><text value=\"String\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\"]()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(tasks.\" /><text value=\"count\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></output></code></body></html>"
