          {
            "title": "If 1",
            "id": 127056,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo usare il conteggio di un array per creare <strong>istruzioni condizionali</strong> che dipendono dal numero dei suoi elementi.</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" tasks = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;windows&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;vacuum&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" tasks.\" /><text value=\"count\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\" &gt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ugh, more work!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Ugh, more work!\" /></content></output></code></body></html>"
